      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ witena gerædnes is, þæt man Christene men ⁊ unforworhte of earde ne sylle, ne huru on hæþene þeode; ac beorge man georne þæt man þa sawla ne forfare þe Crist mid his agenum life gebohte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is the decree of the councillors that Christian men who are innocent of crime shall not be sold out of the land, least of all to the heathen, but care shall diligently be taken that the souls which Christ bought with his own life be not destroyed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
